From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A7om <hatter6822@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] docs/system/arm: Document the raspi5b machine

Describe the Raspberry Pi 5 model: the devices it implements and those
it does not yet, how it boots (EL2 with PSCI, or EL3 with secure=on),
its device tree handling and machine properties, and how to run a
bare-metal image or the Raspberry Pi OS kernel on it. List the page next
to the other Raspberry Pi boards.
---
 MAINTAINERS                | 1 +
 docs/system/target-arm.rst | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index 9b0d2be..5e7f379 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -1026,6 +1026,7 @@ F: include/hw/*/bcm27*
 F: include/hw/*/bcm283*
 F: include/hw/intc/brcmstb_l2_intc.h
 F: docs/system/arm/raspi.rst
+F: docs/system/arm/raspi5b.rst
 F: tests/functional/arm/test_raspi2.py
 F: tests/functional/aarch64/test_raspi*.py
 F: tests/qtest/raspi5b-test.c
diff --git a/docs/system/target-arm.rst b/docs/system/target-arm.rst
index e344924..8974100 100644
--- a/docs/system/target-arm.rst
+++ b/docs/system/target-arm.rst
@@ -97,6 +97,7 @@ Board-specific documentation
    arm/imx8m
    arm/orangepi
    arm/raspi
+   arm/raspi5b
    arm/collie
    arm/sx1
    arm/stellaris
